  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and sauté until translucent.",
    "Stir in the minced garlic, sliced carrot, and sliced celery, cooking for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the rosemary, thyme, olives, coconut cream, and vegetable broth to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a gentle boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Season with sea salt to taste and stir once more.",
    "Transfer the broth into a bamboo steamer and steam for 5 minutes to meld flavors.",
